TEXT 0 640 Left 2 ;Candidate front end: passive 10k/1k reference and RTD divider, non-inverting LT1078 stage on 0-6V. Approx 0.30V at 0C and 2.98V at 200C. NOT verified in LTspice here. Final PCB requires LM358 model, precision/error analysis, and ADC protection.
